# Line endings are part of the build: a checkout that turns LF into CRLF builds other bytes, and
# the store hash no longer reproduces. Measured 2026-09-15: a clone with core.autocrlf=true built
# 19cd3d42... against the store build's c51e1b7e...; with this rule in the repository the same
# clone built c51e1b7e..., a match. Every text file stays LF on every system, in this repository
# and in the public copy (scripts/public-snapshot.mjs copies this file).
* text=auto eol=lf
.githooks/* text eol=lf
